    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just burnout though. it's everyone. the articles, the comments, the way my old colleagues won't even return my calls. it's not a phase. the person i was is gone and the world has already made its decision about me. it feels like i'm just a ghost walking around in a body that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
